// Iron ore. Generated as a threshold in the density pass, not as a structure
// (PHASE2_ARCHITECTURE.md §6) -- it replaces stone and never surfaces.
//
// No `drops` or `requires_tier` yet: §4 designs both, but Material carries
// neither today, and a field the engine ignores is worse than no field.
// Mining, tiers and drops are block 2.4.
Material(
    name:   "cubara:iron_ore",
    solid:  true,
    faces:  All("iron_ore"),
    shapes: [Full],
)
